  "section": "37",
  "quote": "A notice of termination need not be given if a landlord and a tenant have agreed to terminate a tenancy.",
  "reason": "Section 37(3) explicitly states that a notice of termination is not required if the landlord and tenant agree to terminate the tenancy. Since the clause specifies that this agreement happens after the tenancy has begun, it also complies with subsection 37(5) and is completely consistent with the Act."
}

